            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Access control: Missing connect state check. Categories: Access control. Weaknesses: CWE-287, CWE-306, CWE-476."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Access control: Missing connect state check. Categories: Access control. Weaknesses: CWE-287, CWE-306, CWE-476.\n\n## Remediation\n\nReject every packet other than CONNECT until the connection has completed a successful CONNECT and has a non-NULL session. Enforce authorization in the dispatch layer, not only in connect_handler, and return a protocol error for premature packets.",
                "text": "Access control: Missing connect state check. Categories: Access control. Weaknesses: CWE-287, CWE-306, CWE-476.\n\nRemediation:\n\nReject every packet other than CONNECT until the connection has completed a successful CONNECT and has a non-NULL session. Enforce authorization in the dispatch layer, not only in connect_handler, and return a protocol error for premature packets."
              },
              "id": "access-control.missing-connect-state-check",
              "name": "Access control: Missing connect state check",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "8.2",
                "tags": [
