            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Client write buffer overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-122, CWE-787."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Client write buffer overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-122, CWE-787.\n\n## Remediation\n\nTrack the remaining capacity for wbuf and fail or disconnect when a reply would exceed it; grow the buffer dynamically for queued messages. Validate retained and fan-out message sizes against the destination's free space before packing.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Client write buffer overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-122, CWE-787.\n\nRemediation:\n\nTrack the remaining capacity for wbuf and fail or disconnect when a reply would exceed it; grow the buffer dynamically for queued messages. Validate retained and fan-out message sizes against the destination's free space before packing."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.client-write-buffer-overflow",
              "name": "Memory safety: Client write buffer overflow",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "9.1",
                "tags": [
