                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Client write buffer overflow"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Connect client ID overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-121, CWE-787."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Connect client ID overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-121, CWE-787.\n\n## Remediation\n\nReject CONNECT when cid_len >= MQTT_CLIENT_ID_LEN or when cid_len exceeds the remaining packet body, and copy with a bounded length. Prefer allocating client IDs dynamically or enforcing the MQTT 3.1.1 23-byte minimum limit.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Connect client ID overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-121, CWE-787.\n\nRemediation:\n\nReject CONNECT when cid_len >= MQTT_CLIENT_ID_LEN or when cid_len exceeds the remaining packet body, and copy with a bounded length. Prefer allocating client IDs dynamically or enforcing the MQTT 3.1.1 23-byte minimum limit."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.connect-client-id-overflow",
              "name": "Memory safety: Connect client ID overflow",
              "properties": {
