                "text": "Memory safety: Decoder length underflow. Categories: Memory safety. Weaknesses: CWE-125, CWE-191, CWE-787.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBefore each subtraction, verify that the field length fits in the remaining bytes (remaining >= 1 + 2 + topic_len for SUBSCRIBE tuples, and remaining >= 2 + topic_len for PUBLISH). Reject truncated packets with a protocol error instead of subtracting."
