            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Inflight ack stale pointer. Categories: Denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-476."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Inflight ack stale pointer. Categories: Denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-476.\n\n## Remediation\n\nPass &ack to mqtt_pack in the ACK branch and compute the size from the same packet that is serialized. Reset p per iteration or avoid sharing it between the two branches.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Inflight ack stale pointer. Categories: Denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-476.\n\nRemediation:\n\nPass &ack to mqtt_pack in the ACK branch and compute the size from the same packet that is serialized. Reset p per iteration or avoid sharing it between the two branches."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.inflight-ack-stale-pointer",
              "name": "Memory safety: Inflight ack stale pointer",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.3",
                "tags": [
                  "denial-of-service",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-476",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Inflight ack stale pointer"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Null and out of bounds dispatch. Categories: Denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-129, CWE-476."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Null and out of bounds dispatch. Categories: Denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-129, CWE-476.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate the packet type before both dispatch tables, reject every type the broker does not implement, and size the tables to the full 0-15 range with explicit NULL checks. Return a protocol error instead of calling through a missing entry.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Null and out of bounds dispatch. Categories: Denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-129, CWE-476.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate the packet type before both dispatch tables, reject every type the broker does not implement, and size the tables to the full 0-15 range with explicit NULL checks. Return a protocol error instead of calling through a missing entry."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.null-and-out-of-bounds-dispatch",
              "name": "Memory safety: Null and out of bounds dispatch",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "7.5",
